Bind Npc 31566 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31565 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 656 "Searching Specialties III"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Appraiser] Rockus."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Appraiser] Diz."
    Collect 5 of 389450000

Requires player level >= 66 and quest 655 is completed

Rewards
    Give 8750000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I guess appraising is a difficult thing. It's about time for [Item Appraiser] Lockers to look for you.  Shall we go to him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I guess appraising is a difficult thing. It's about time for [Item Appraiser] Disney to look for you.  Shall we go to him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hmm... It's almost done. Its superb quality gets me so excited. So the next appraisal is on the second item you collected."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Well, we still have a lot of time left.  In the meantime, let's collect the next item. I need [Thick Half Troll Leather] from [Half Troll Captain]. It's the toughest of all leather. You can take your time on this.\n\nAppraisers of Goods Eslant updated according to the rocker's request, from [half-trolls Captain], [Thick Leather Half-Troll to come sujiphae the."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hmm... It's almost done. Its superb quality gets me so excited. So the next appraisal is on the second item you collected."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Well, we still have a lot of time left.  In the meantime, let's collect the next item. I need [Thick Half Troll Leather] from [Half Troll Captain]. It's the toughest of all leather. You can take your time on this.\n\nAt the request of the Appraisers of Goods Eslant updated Deeds from [half-trolls Captain], [Thick Leather Half-Troll sujiphae expected."

On in_progress
    Say "You don't have it yet? It's okay. Please take your time."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good timing. All appraisals are finished.\n\nIt's taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you're waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it'll cost a hundred thousand Noahs, so bring the money. Don't worry. I'll give you the money when you bring the receipt."
